  "title": "About UCI MATH CEO",
  "body": " About UCI MATH CEO   UCI MATH CEO logo: University of California, Irvine anteater mascot with the words \"Math CEO\"   UC Irvine Math CEO is a free, innovative comprehensive, high-quality math enrichment program designed to empower secondary students in underserved communities in Southern California through joyful after-school activities, collaboration, mentorship and intergenerational learning.     UCI MATH CEO logo, marking the website link    MATH CEO Website      YouTube logo, marking the channel link    Math CEO YouTube Channel      Our Goals     Promote  students' interest and proficiency in mathematics, through engaging mathematical explorations that are relevant to youth, and inclusive, culturally-responsive, informal pedagogical practices.    Support  students' socio-emotional development and wellbeing, by fostering positive relationships with peers and college mentors.    Foster  a college-going identity in youth, increase their familiarity with college and set the foundations to be successful in STEM careers.       Special Thanks      NSF — National Science Foundation logo   NSF AISL 2215695    UC Links to Learning After School logo    The Nicholas Endowment logo    University of California Irvine logo    Department of Mathematics, University of California Irvine logo     "
